    "fix": "This is exactly why the prompt tells the AI to write \"none\" for anything it can't find, and why parse_fields() turns that into a real None rather than trusting whatever text comes back. If you still see fabricated values, make the field's description in FIELDS more specific (e.g. \"a phone number that literally appears in the text\" rather than just \"a phone number\") and re-run - vague field descriptions invite the AI to fill in a plausible guess.",
